@startuml ProductList
' 商品一覧（ProductList）の MVI の流れ
'
' Intent ──▶ Processor ──Action──▶ Reducer ──State──▶ UI
'                │
'                └──SideEffect──▶ UI
'
' シーケンス図は Graphviz なしで描画できるので、この形式で書いている

title ProductList の流れ

skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "UI\n(Compose / SwiftUI)" as UI
participant "ProductListProcessor" as Processor
participant "ProductListReducer" as Reducer

UI -> Processor : Intent\n・Load\n・ClickProduct(id)
Processor -> Reducer : Action\n・LoadStarted\n・LoadSucceeded(products)\n・LoadFailed(message)
Reducer -> UI : State\n(ProductListUiState)
Processor -[#red]-> UI : SideEffect（1 回きり）\n・NavigateToDetail(id)

@enduml
